# UI Rules


## Design System

Use:

- HeroUI
- Tailwind CSS v4
- next-themes


==================================================
COMPONENT RULES
==================================================

Components must be:

- reusable
- accessible
- responsive
- composable

==================================================
DESIGN TOKENS
==================================================

Never hardcode:

colors
spacing
font sizes

Use:

semantic tokens.

Example:

bg-primary
text-muted
border-default


==================================================
DARK MODE
==================================================

Every component must support:

Light mode
Dark mode

Use:
next-themes

Avoid:

manual theme handling.


==================================================
ACCESSIBILITY
==================================================

Follow:

WCAG AA


Support:


keyboard navigation

screen readers

proper labels

focus states


==================================================
RESPONSIVE DESIGN
==================================================

Design mobile-first.


Support:


mobile

tablet

desktop


==================================================
FORMS
==================================================

Use:


React Hook Form

Zod

Forms require:

loading state
error state
success feedback


==================================================
NOTIFICATIONS
==================================================

Use:

HeroUI Toast component

import { Toast, Button, toast } from '@heroui/react';

<div>
    <Toast.Provider />
    <Button onPress={() => toast("Simple message")}>
    Show toast
    </Button>
</div>

For:

success messages

errors

warnings